{
    "version": "1.1.1",
    "description": "Windows AgentDock with Scoop-managed binaries and a persistent Scoop runtime directory.",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/uvwt/agentdock",
    "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nonlog/scoop-www/master/icons/agentdock.ico",
    "license": "Apache-2.0",
    "depends": "innounp",
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://github.com/uvwt/agentdock/releases/download/v1.1.1/AgentDockSetup-amd64.exe",
            "hash": "d827881daf824faf5c47279b92a29e2e0deac64f9e75515f2c749d5fc140b4cd"
        }
    },
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "control-panel\\agentdock-tray.exe",
            "AgentDock Tray",
            "",
            "agentdock.ico"
        ]
    ],
    "pre_install": [
        "& \"$bucketsdir\\$bucket\\scripts\\agentdock\\unpack.ps1\" -PackageDir $dir -SetupPath \"$dir\\$fname\"",
        "& \"$bucketsdir\\$bucket\\scripts\\agentdock\\sync.ps1\" -Phase pre -PackageDir \"$dir\" -RuntimeRoot 'D:\\Programs\\Scoop\\persist\\agentdock'"
    ],
    "post_install": "& \"$bucketsdir\\$bucket\\scripts\\agentdock\\sync.ps1\" -Phase post -PackageDir \"$dir\" -RuntimeRoot 'D:\\Programs\\Scoop\\persist\\agentdock'",
    "notes": [
        "AgentDock 程序由 Scoop 管理，配置和 DPAPI 认证文件保留在 D:\\Programs\\Scoop\\persist\\agentdock。",
        "升级时将现有已签名 cloudflared 导入 AgentDock components；后续由 AgentDock 组件管理器维护。",
        "Windows Setup 内的官方程序包由 Scoop 解包；托盘所需的 Microsoft 运行库通过上游检查器验证并按需安装。",
        "更新命令：scoop update agentdock"
    ],
    "checkver": {
        "url": "https://github.com/uvwt/agentdock/releases/latest",
        "regex": "/releases/tag/v([\\d.]+)"
    },
    "autoupdate": {
        "architecture": {
            "64bit": {
                "url": "https://github.com/uvwt/agentdock/releases/download/v$version/AgentDockSetup-amd64.exe"
            }
        }
    }
}
